  "definition": "Initial Loan Documents (ILDs) for Non-Governmental Entities",
  "effectiveDate": "2022-12-20",
  "historyNote": "(See Revision Notes #1-#3 at chapter heading for Env-Wq 500) #10984, eff 12-1-15; ss by #13511, eff 12-20-22",
